WEBVTT

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:13.920
Look, Sister! I made a flower crown!

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.250
My, how wonderful, Vermeil!

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.670
You've done a lovely job, too!

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:23.040
Mielle showed me how!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.330
Thank you. Does it make me look pretty?

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:33.170
Really pretty! You look like you're gonna get married!

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.580
That's Vermeil when she was a little girl...

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.830
Doesn't she look happy?

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:46.420
Huh?

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.250
She's happy now, too.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:57.750
But the happiness she felt then and
the happiness she feels now are not the same.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:06.170
You're hogging all of Sister's time again!

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:07.290
No fair!

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.420
I wanna hug her, too!

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.830
M-me, too!

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:17.330
That is her family.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:24.290
They were not of the same blood,
but they were her family in the truest sense.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:48.580
Shiro ka kuro kongaragatte gray

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.790
Itsudatte aimai na mama de

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:57.790
Tayorinaku aruku tonari de hohoenderu kimi

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:01.250
Akogare wa tashika da toshite

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:04.460
Hateshinaku tooku mabushii

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:10.250
Chippokena kono genjou Abracada-Boo mahou kakete yo

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:16.420
Kimi no hitomi no yami ni kakushita

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:23.080
Samishisa wa yasashii uta de dakishimeteitai no ni

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:27.830
Sekaijuu ga uso datte sawagihajimetatte

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.580
Kimi ga kimi naraba

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:36.830
Kirameku kaze o makiokoshi shinjitsu o sakebu

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.460
Sekaijuu ga tsumi datte togameta toshitatte

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.170
Tatta hitori demo

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:46.330
Kimi o rikai shi tsuzuketai

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:51.830
I'm on your side mamotte ageru

00:02:56.710 --> 00:03:00.380
<b>PAST</b>

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:06.880
C'mon, Vermeil, you keep inhaling your food
like that and you'll choke again.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:11.540
See? What'd I tell you?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.500
Your stew is super yummy, Mielle!

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.210
I know.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:23.170
That's 'cause I'm good at everything!

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:27.580
Oh yeah, today, I made a flower crown,
just like how you showed me!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.710
Sister really liked it!

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.380
Yeah, I know. She's sitting right next to you.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.750
Sister, you didn't need to wear it to dinner, y'know.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:42.420
I don't see why not.
Vermeil made it especially for me, after all.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.880
Mielle! I wanna make one, too!

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.130
No fair! Me, too!

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:50.080
Goodness, crowns from Lin and Cait, too?

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.210
How're you gonna wear three crowns at once?

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.330
Seconds, please!

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:58.460
Do you ever listen to anything I say?
There aren't any seconds!

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:06.250
She lived in a run-down abbey
on the outskirts of the town.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.830
Poor, yes, but always smiling.

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:15.170
Those times were the happiest in her life.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:21.130
Those people were Vermeil's family.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:26.960
We don't know how she came to be in their care.

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:32.580
She said she had been with
them for as long as she could remember.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.080
I'm a demon?

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:42.630
That's why I have these horns on my head?

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.920
That's right, but there's nothing wrong about that.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:52.830
Really? Demons are bad, right?
Mielle said they're God's worst enemies.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:57.210
Hmm... You're right, some demons do bad things.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.670
And you're friends with God, right, Sister?

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:03.880
Why are you being nice to me? I'm a demon.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:07.040
That's simple.

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:11.630
You're a part of our family.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.830
That's it?

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:19.500
That's it. You, Mielle, Lin, and Cait...

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:24.290
As long as the five of us are together,
I'm not afraid of anyone, not even God, Himself.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:26.630
There, all done.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.290
Thank you, Sister!

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:33.290
You'll need to learn how to do it
by yourself soon, all right?

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:38.330
The Sister there knew she was a demon.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.670
Of course she knew.

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.580
But she was the only one.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:49.750
This was back in the days
where demons were well-known and feared.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:55.000
Humans were much more afraid of demons
than they are today.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.000
The woman of the cloth who took care of Vermeil
in spite of her service to God

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.880
most certainly exhibited the qualities of a saint.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.000
Hold on.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:16.710
If she had family, then why did
Vermeil decide to seal herself away?

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.170
Do you sense a turn for the worse?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:27.330
Your sense is correct. You would do well
to steel yourself for what comes next.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.290
There she is!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:30.750
The demon!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.710
C'mon, say something, demon scum!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.080
Get out of our town, demon!

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:44.330
Yeah! You really think
you can hang out with us humans?!

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:49.210
Stop it... Stop, please!

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:54.080
It started when a few neighborhood children
discovered her horns.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:57.920
My, my. Are you angry?

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.920
Of course I'm angry! How dare they do that to her?

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.630
Then you should not watch these next memories.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.500
Huh? What do you mean?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.750
Hey, you little brats!

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:14.750
What're you doing to Vermeil?!

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.080
Crap, it's Mielle!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.330
R-run!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:22.500
You all right, Vermeil?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:27.670
Those little bastards. Teasing's one thing,
but this is straight-up bullying!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.670
Mielle...

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:36.920
Vermeil! Wait, are you...

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:42.040
W-wait, Mielle! My horns are just...

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:45.460
I'm... I'm not...

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:49.080
I'm sorry! I didn't want to lie to you...

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:53.040
I'm really sorry.

00:07:56.920 --> 00:08:00.000
I'm sorry.

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.460
Don't worry.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:10.960
It's gonna be all right.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:13.580
Mielle...

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.830
Rest easy.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:20.790
I'm gonna keep you safe.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:27.960
I'm... your big sister, after all.

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:34.750
Let's go home. Back to our family.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.420
Come out here!

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:41.880
You vile demon!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.830
How dare you deceive us all these years!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.290
We will not live alongside a demon!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.710
Sheesh, don't they have anything better to do?

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:54.670
The rumor has spread throughout the town now.
This was to be expected.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.750
Bastards, the lot of them.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:01.000
Sister, um...

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:04.330
You're fine, Vermeil.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.000
You're such a good, virtuous girl.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:15.000
I know God will save us.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.380
It's all right.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.460
Another death!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.540
Bring out the demon!

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:32.250
Bring it out!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.710
Where's the demon kid?!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.790
We know she's in there!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.540
You took my child from me!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.670
Get out, you demon scum!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.290
Why did it get worse?

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:48.830
The town was beset by a plague
that killed dozens of its people.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.250
Sure, but-!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:54.250
Why are you saying Vermeil has done this?!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:55.500
Shut up!

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:59.130
Everything that's happening to us
is that demon child's doing!

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:02.130
Are you still going to protect it, even now?!

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.790
Do you know how many people have died because of it?!

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:05.790
You're wrong!

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:10.540
Vermeil... Vermeil's a sweet, innocent child!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:15.000
I will not stand for the insults and accusations
flung at my precious girl!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.830
God may forgive you for your sins...

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:22.540
But you will never have my forgiveness!

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.130
You have no say in this, Sister!

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.420
Move!

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.630
We'll drag the demon out ourselves!

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.250
Mielle...

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:34.540
I...

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.580
I could...

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.000
Mielle!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:46.790
Vermeil!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.460
Listen close, Vermeil.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.630
Leave us here and run away.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.750
You're fast. I know you can make it.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.960
Get outside the town and go
as far away as you can from here.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.130
But what about you?

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:10.380
Lin and Cait aren't fast enough to get away.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:15.580
C'mon, don't you worry. I'll figure something out.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:19.330
And then we'll be together as a family again.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:22.540
Mielle...

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.250
I'm sorry, Vermeil.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.790
I'm their big sister, too.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:41.420
I can't leave them to run away with you.

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:46.130
I'm sorry I couldn't keep you safe.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:51.790
I'm sorry I can't be with you.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.710
I'm so sorry, Vermeil.

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:01.830
I'm sorry I'm not strong enough.

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:06.330
I want you to live.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.830
It's all right, Mielle.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.790
It's all right.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:26.540
I'll be all right. Stay with Lin and Cait.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:32.130
You're the best big sister ever, Mielle!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.420
Owie...

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.540
Mielle... Sister...

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:13.880
Did you find it?!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:16.130
No, no sight of it!

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.960
Damn it all, they let it get away!

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:21.170
We're not going to let it escape!

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:24.540
Curse those fools from the abbey
for protecting that thing!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.040
Let's head back for now!

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:28.250
We'll force them to tell us where it went!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:34.380
If I run away, they'll get hurt...

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.250
Vile demon... When we find it, we'll cut it to pieces!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.920
Yeah! Cut it down and burn the remains!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.880
We'll make it pay for the scourge it's laid upon our town!

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:08.750
That's it! I'm done running!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:14.210
If I let them have me, then Sister,
and Mielle, and everyone will be safe!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.170
I just need to turn that corner, and I'll be at our abbey!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.880
I can do it! I can save them all!

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:51.880
Sister?

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.710
Mielle?

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:13.710
Why? I came back.

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.630
Sister?

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:23.710
Vermeil, our God in Heaven is kind
and loves good little boys and girls.

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.460
Really?

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.540
Am I a good little girl?

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.670
But of course.

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:35.250
I know God must love you very much.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.460
Hey, there's the brat!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.380
L-look at its horns!

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.960
It's really a demon!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.710
The demon child!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.170
Get it!

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:01.670
Flay it alive!

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:04.670
Kill it! Kill it!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:09.960
Don't worry, Vermeil. You're a part of our family.

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:15.920
You're such a good, virtuous girl.
I know God will save us.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:28.420
Kill it! Hang it! Kill it! Hang it!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:20.830
Our God in Heaven is kind
and loves good little boys and girls.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:25.290
I know God must love you very much.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:29.960
Blasphemous bastards like them deserve death!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:48.630
Kill it! Kill it! Kill it!

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:04.710
Vermeil!

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:22.130
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.210
I'm so sorry.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:34.580
Ver...Vermeil...

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.630
Well? You see it now, yes?

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:44.920
This was the calamity she brought upon the town.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:55.330
The plague was nothing compared
to the destruction of life and land she caused.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:58.460
That is the power she possesses.

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:03.330
That was the moment her life of loneliness began.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:07.670
It would be two hundred years
until she would be sealed away,

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:14.210
during which time she became well-known
as the "strongest scourge" to afflict mankind.

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:19.750
Her power is the most difficult to control
and most detested amongst demonkind.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:22.750
Despite this, will you still treasure her?

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:39.420
Vermeil... How much have you suffered?

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.790
Um, who are you?

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:58.460
I did something really bad.

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:03.960
Something I can never, ever take back.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:13.330
Something so bad that no one
will ever like me ever again.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:24.920
It's all right.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.380
It's all right.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.790
I'm here with you.

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:44.080
But I destroyed the town.
Everyone is dead because of me.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:58.000
I've been feeling this way for a while,
but I've never been able to say it for some reason.

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:04.330
Vermeil...

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:08.580
I know you tried your best.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:19.790
Alto, I... I killed everyone!

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:23.920
I could never, ever tell anyone...

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:32.040
If I told anyone, they'd hate me! I knew they would!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:39.580
I'm a monster who should be alone!
No one will ever love me!

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.000
I'd never hate you.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:52.380
And it's not just me. Your Sister, Mielle,
and your siblings, none of them would hate you.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:57.130
That's right. I finally understand.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:04.420
I still don't know if these feelings are right,
but it doesn't matter.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:11.170
She may be the strongest scourge
to walk the face of the Earth, but I don't care.

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:17.630
If they're going to say that being with you is wrong,
then I don't want to be right.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:29.960
Vermeil, even if the entire world turns against us,
I'll always stay by your side.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:32.710
Alto...

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:39.830
I want to be with you forever.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:00.710
I love you, Vermeil.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:05.540
You'll never be alone again. Not on my watch.

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:22.580
Does it get easier with time for the immortal?

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:33.290
If I was born normal, if I become normal, can I stay close?

00:22:33.880 --> 00:22:38.710
With the children, we link our arms

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.920
Make a circle and sing a song

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:50.670
Knowing there was no chair for me all along

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:55.960
You locked me into the dark, I'm your preserved flower

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:59.630
The world is too slow to understand

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:03.210
Not all blossoms spark, And spikes may be sharp

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:07.750
They only want to see the beautiful parts

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:11.130
Sitting in a shower of scarlet rain

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:15.460
It all used to be ours, I'm counting the hours

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:18.920
Hours that stood between us like a river

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
Once I crawled through the water

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:26.460
All I ever knew have become distant past
